msgstr "Ingoa (hei tauira Mama)"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:880
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"Koinei te rahinga oro waea mō ia putanga. Ka pā aunoa te taumata ina hono te "
"waea, i ngā wā katoa hoki e rerekē ai te putanga i te wā o te waea, ā, ka "
"rangona tonutia ngā panonitanga o te rēreti. Ka pā te pūrere i ngā taumata "
"mā ngā hikoinga rarahi, ā, e kore rawa te pīhi taringa e tino wahangū. Ka "
"penapenatia te taumata Bluetooth mō te tautoko arataki e haere ake nei."

